        "congressionalglo7393unit:769:par_000769_000010": {
          "text": "I hope my amendment will meet with the approval of the chairman of the Committee of Ways and Means, [Mr. Morrill;] or, if it does not, that he will at least explain that it is not necessary under the law.",
          "sha256": "09c226d74ac911541f163ff3d1d37af4f5c1fe435a7a56bfe12f61ea2eb2ee4b",
          "raw_sha256": "09c226d74ac911541f163ff3d1d37af4f5c1fe435a7a56bfe12f61ea2eb2ee4b",
          "mapping": [
            {
              "raw_start": 0,
